sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant Backend as Backend
    participant LLM as Local LLM
    participant XGBoost as XGBoost Classifier
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Frontend: Submits Game Concept<br>(Title, Description, Genres, etc.)
    Frontend->>Backend: POST JSON Request
    
    Backend->>LLM: Sends Description
    Note right of LLM: Analyzes text for hype, story,<br/> and nostalgia factors
    LLM-->>Backend: Returns JSON Scores
    
    Backend->>Backend: Merge LLM Scores with<br>Original Input Attributes
    
    Backend->>XGBoost: Sends Complete Input Attributes
    Note right of XGBoost: Classifies as<br>successful or not
    XGBoost-->>Backend: Returns Hit/Flop Prediction
    
    Backend->>DB: Insert log into Models_History<br>(tokensUsed, modelUsed, userid)
    DB-->>Backend: Log confirmed
    
    Backend-->>Frontend: Sends Final Result
    Frontend-->>User: Displays Result in Dashboard